.pytest_cache/
data/
# Voice KB corpus is version-controlled — deploys with the code
!api/data/voice_kb/
!api/data/voice_kb/**
# D2 CP1 canonical address book is version-controlled ON PURPOSE. It is DERIVED
# (tools/build_canonical_address_book.py) but it is not scratch output: a
# generated file that is not committed cannot be diffed in review, and a
# canonical form nobody reviews is a second authority with extra steps. The
# derivation rail regenerates and byte-compares it, so the committed copy can
# never drift from the declarations it is built from.
#
# ⛔ IT IS TRACKED BY `git add -f`, NOT BY THE NEGATION BELOW-STYLE PATTERN, AND
# SAYING SO MATTERS. Git cannot re-include a file whose PARENT DIRECTORY is
# excluded, and `data/` on line 11 excludes `api/data/` itself — so a
# `!api/data/<file>` line here would read like a working mechanism and do
# nothing. (⚠️ That is also true of the `!api/data/voice_kb/**` lines above:
# those files are tracked because they were force-added, not because of the
# negation. Recorded, not fixed — they are not this program's.)
# `tests/test_canonical_address_book.py::test_the_book_is_committed_data_not_a_
# build_artifact` is what actually holds the line: it asks git whether the file
# is tracked, which is the property we want, rather than trusting a pattern.
# Phase 3B Lane A VCP gold-standard validation evidence (rubric, candidate
# pool, frozen case packets, blinded review results, adjudication + metrics)
# is version-controlled -- it is the reproducible evidence trail for the
# program's decision log, not regenerable scratch output.
!docs/uct-scanner-intelligence/vcp_gold_standard/data/
!docs/uct-scanner-intelligence/vcp_gold_standard/data/**
# Phase 5 Tier-1 multi-pattern validation evidence (per-family audit
# results: validation cards, defect-class findings, geometry/provenance
# readiness, P0-P3 issue lists) -- reproducible evidence trail for the
# program's decision log, same rationale as the VCP gold-standard data above.
!docs/uct-scanner-intelligence/tier1_validation/data/
!docs/uct-scanner-intelligence/tier1_validation/data/**
*.json.bak
