# Wave Q1 daily window check writes here every morning. Operational, not a
# record: the durable record is the stamped row in wave-q1-RESUME-HERE.md.
# Tracking it would leave the worktree permanently dirty and every future
# pre-flight would have to explain away a modified file.
docs/notebook/window-check.log

# Gate wrapper shard logs — large, per-run, and regenerated every time. The MANIFESTS
# (.json/.md) beside them are the evidence and stay tracked.
docs/plans/joystick/gate-runs/*.log
# the Notebook's own gate runs: keep the REPORT, never the multi-MB shard logs
docs/notebook/gate-runs/*.log
docs/plans/joystick/gate-runs/INVALID-*.md
